q188-order [188]: fidelity PASS; complete sequence-order statement tests first/last and immediate adjacency. A and C isolate a skipped-neighbor error and reversed endpoints; this is a coherent relational response, not four clicks. Redundancy PASS: no equivalent options. Leakage PASS: the table is legitimate input, not an annotated answer, and no other view gives these team relationships.
