Repair: alter/add a coherent alternative with a genuinely incorrect predecessor relation (e.g. a2,a5 -> a3,a6 from using successors, or swapped associations) while retaining successor and endpoint contrasts. Re-review changed option mathematics and misconception; do not change the correct set without mathematical reason.

